      "title": "PFCP: get rid of forward declarations by moving ie-decoder-table down",
      "message": "PFCP: get rid of forward declarations by moving ie-decoder-table down\n\nPart of cleanup that will ease refactorings in later commits.\nRemove all forward declarations and move the table containing references\nto those functions down.\n",
      "author_name": "jpeeraer",
      "author_email": "joris.peeraer@nokia.com",
